{
  "name": "UMKM 01 — Auto-Reply WhatsApp/Telegram (Keyword Bot)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Pesan Masuk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 320],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "GANTI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot UMKM"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "chat_id", "value": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "a2", "name": "pesan", "value": "={{ ($json.message.text || '').toLowerCase() }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "a3", "name": "nama", "value": "={{ $json.message.from.first_name || 'Kak' }}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "norm",
      "name": "Baca Pesan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [460, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "s1", "leftValue": "={{ $json.pesan }}", "rightValue": "halo|hai|hi|pagi|siang|sore|malam|assalamualaikum", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "matchesRegex" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "sapaan"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "s2", "leftValue": "={{ $json.pesan }}", "rightValue": "harga|price|berapa|biaya|tarif|list harga", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "matchesRegex" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "harga"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "s3", "leftValue": "={{ $json.pesan }}", "rightValue": "jam|buka|tutup|operasional|kapan", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "matchesRegex" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "jam"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "s4", "leftValue": "={{ $json.pesan }}", "rightValue": "alamat|lokasi|dimana|maps|kantor|toko", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "matchesRegex" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "alamat"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "s5", "leftValue": "={{ $json.pesan }}", "rightValue": "order|pesan|beli|booking|reservasi|kirim", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "matchesRegex" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "order"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "typeValidation": "loose" },
                "conditions": [
                  { "id": "s6", "leftValue": "={{ $json.pesan }}", "rightValue": "admin|manusia|cs|tanya|komplain|masalah", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "matchesRegex" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "admin"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "extra", "renameFallbackOutput": "lainnya" }
      },
      "id": "switch",
      "name": "Deteksi Maksud",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [680, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b1", "name": "balasan", "value": "=Halo {{ $json.nama }}! 👋\n\nSelamat datang di *[NAMA TOKO ANDA]*\n\nSaya asisten virtual yang siap bantu 24 jam.\n\nKetik:\n• *harga* — lihat daftar harga\n• *jam* — jam operasional\n• *alamat* — lokasi toko\n• *order* — cara pesan\n• *admin* — bicara dengan tim kami", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-sapaan",
      "name": "Balas Sapaan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b2", "name": "balasan", "value": "=💰 *DAFTAR HARGA*\n\n📦 Produk A — Rp 50.000\n📦 Produk B — Rp 75.000\n📦 Produk C — Rp 100.000\n\n_(Edit daftar ini sesuai produk Anda)_\n\nKetik *order* untuk mulai pesan, atau *admin* untuk tanya-tanya dulu.", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-harga",
      "name": "Balas Harga",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b3", "name": "balasan", "value": "=🕐 *JAM OPERASIONAL*\n\nSenin – Jumat: 08.00 – 17.00\nSabtu: 08.00 – 15.00\nMinggu & Tanggal Merah: Libur\n\n_(Edit sesuai jam buka toko Anda)_", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-jam",
      "name": "Balas Jam Buka",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b4", "name": "balasan", "value": "=📍 *LOKASI KAMI*\n\n[NAMA TOKO]\nJl. Contoh Alamat No. 123\nKecamatan, Kota Anda\n\nGoogle Maps: https://maps.google.com/?q=ALAMAT_ANDA\n\n_(Edit alamat ini)_", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-alamat",
      "name": "Balas Alamat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b5", "name": "balasan", "value": "=🛒 *CARA ORDER*\n\n1. Ketik produk yang mau dipesan\n2. Kirim nama lengkap\n3. Kirim alamat pengiriman\n4. Tim kami konfirmasi + kirim link pembayaran\n\nEstimasi pengiriman: 1-3 hari kerja.\n\nAtau ketik *admin* kalau mau dibantu langsung.", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-order",
      "name": "Balas Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b6", "name": "balasan", "value": "=Baik {{ $json.nama }}, saya hubungkan ke tim kami ya. 🙏\n\nTim kami akan balas dalam jam kerja (08.00-17.00 WIB).\n\nKalau urgent, hubungi langsung:\n📞 08xx-xxxx-xxxx\n📧 email@tokoanda.com\n\n_(Edit kontak ini)_", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-admin",
      "name": "Balas Hubungi Admin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 620]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "b7", "name": "balasan", "value": "=Maaf {{ $json.nama }}, saya belum paham maksud Anda. 🤔\n\nSaya bisa bantu dengan:\n• *harga* — daftar harga\n• *jam* — jam buka\n• *alamat* — lokasi toko\n• *order* — cara pesan\n• *admin* — hubungi tim kami\n\nCoba ketik salah satu kata di atas ya.", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-lain",
      "name": "Balas Tidak Paham",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [920, 720]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Baca Pesan').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.balasan }}",
        "additionalFields": { "parse_mode": "Markdown" }
      },
      "id": "kirim",
      "name": "Kirim Balasan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1180, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "GANTI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot UMKM"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UMKM 01 — Auto-Reply Bot\n\n**Cocok untuk:** toko online, jasa, kuliner, laundry, bengkel, salon.\n\n**Yang client harus edit:**\n- Nama toko\n- Daftar harga\n- Jam operasional\n- Alamat + Google Maps\n- Kontak admin\n\nSemua ada di node *Balas ...* — tinggal ganti teks.\n\n**Upgrade ke AI:**\nTambah node *AI Agent* + *Groq/Gemini* (gratis) supaya bisa jawab pertanyaan bebas, bukan cuma keyword.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
